    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Ecommerce Cart Summarys-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Summary API provides endpoints for retrieving detailed summaries of user shopping carts within the e-commerce platform. This API allows stakeholders to access essential cart data, such as item counts, pricing, and user activity, enabling optimal inventory management and personalized user experiences. Typical consumers of this API include e-commerce analysts, marketing teams, and developers seeking to enhance user engagement and streamline shopping experiences. Utilize this API to stay informed about cart contents and make informed business decisions.",
